WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.260
Breakfast in a café. What do they like to drink?

2
00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:07.830
Co lubisz pić rano?

3
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.880
Lubię kawę z mlekiem. A ty?

4
00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:15.710
Coffee changes its ending after the verb to like.

5
00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:17.920
Ja wolę herbatę.

6
00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:21.390
Lubię kawę.

7
00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:29.750
After like, want, have, eat and drink, the object changes.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:37.500
Feminine words in a take a new ending; men and animals add a.

9
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:43.260
Bartek likes coffee. What does he say?

10
00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:47.460
Lubię kawę.

11
00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:52.020
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

12
00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.020
Lubię kawę.

13
00:00:57.020 --> 00:01:00.860
Ania is drinking tea. What does she say?

14
00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:05.180
Piję herbatę.

15
00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:09.740
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

16
00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:12.860
Piję herbatę.

17
00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:18.660
Bartek has a dog. What does he say?

18
00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:22.740
Mam psa.

19
00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:27.300
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

20
00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:30.180
Mam psa.

21
00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:35.820
